     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Hen-Chao,<div><br></div><div>最近使用 Win 10 + Microsoft SQL Server 2016 開發版, 以R-3.3.2 連結皆正常, 參考以下回覆.</div><div><br></div><div>1. ODBC-64位元重新設定.</div><div><br></div><div>2. 試著用 ODBC-32位元重新設定.</div><div><br></div><div>3. 嘗試安裝RODBC舊版本, 考慮從 &quot;RODBC_1.3-13.tar.gz&quot; 開始.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/RODBC/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/RODBC/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237771237000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yDYXC5aOeC6iRJsDq4c8U\">https://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/RODBC/</a></div><div><br></div><div><br>Hen-Chao Chang於 2017年3月7日星期二 UTC+8上午9時31分20秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"4\"><b>我用 RODBC 連結 SQL server，每個月都會執行一次。</b></font><div><font size=\"4\"><b>上個月還執行ok，今天卻出現錯誤如下：</b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><br></font></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red\"><font size=\"4\">&gt; library(RODBC)</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red\"><font size=\"4\">&gt; channel &lt;-\r\nodbcConnect(&quot;R_SQL117_2&quot;,pw=&quot;**************&quot;)</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><font size=\"4\">Warning messages:</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><font size=\"4\">1: In\r\nRODBC::odbcDriverConnect(&quot;DSN=R_SQL117_2;PWD=**************&quot;) :</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"4\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\">  [RODBC] ERROR: state IM014, code 0, message\r\n[Microsoft][ODBC </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#0000cc\">驅動程式管理員</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\">]\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#0000cc\">指定之</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"> DSN </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#0000cc\">中的驅動程式和應用程式架構不相符</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"></span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><font size=\"4\">2: In\r\nRODBC::odbcDriverConnect(&quot;DSN=R_SQL117_2;PWD=**************&quot;) :</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><font size=\"4\">  ODBC connection failed</font></span></p>\r\n\